WEBVTT

00:14:57.434 --> 00:15:02.105
This is what will enable African nations
to build more sustainable cities.

00:15:02.105 --> 00:15:05.776
MR: Yeah, you mentioned the projects
that you are working on

00:15:05.776 --> 00:15:07.778
in rural schools

00:15:07.819 --> 00:15:14.493
to have solar panels
and a better cook stove system.

00:15:14.993 --> 00:15:19.373
What other projects that you know of
or that you've seen

00:15:19.414 --> 00:15:23.293
or that you've heard of
particularly excite you?

00:15:23.293 --> 00:15:28.799
VN: So this project is really to educate
young people about trees

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.134
and also to grow these trees with them.